```clafer
xor Jurisdiction
    Europe 
        UK ?
    mux NorthAmerica
        USA
        Canada
    Australia
    NewZealand

[ some Europe => some LeftGreenArrow && some RightGreenArrow ]
[ Jurisdiction.Europe => TrafficLightSystem.mountLocation.inFront ]
[ NorthAmerica => behind ]
```